How I did it:
Usually I play as wizard, because it is my favorite class. They use
to die very quickly, if I don't feel theirs potential. This one
seemed to be not very perspective, because started with knock spell
as second, but had =RoSD. It helped me much through all course of game.
I gave chance to him, and two levels lower found spellbok of identify.
I count identify as most useful spell. I'm just can't calmly play
without it. This spell greatly slowed my descention, because took
much of MP and I used to wait for it's regeneration. I think, such
behavior helped to survive. Also, near of start I found magic whistle,
which helped to manipulate pets. They helped to kill unicorn and
get his corn. I had /WoMI in starting inventory (I still had it when win),
so was invisible from start. Not so long after I'm got Magicbane. I
hoped also to get books from god, but he gave me stupid Demonbane...
At first level of socoban I found /WoW (0:2) and wished for +4 [DDSM,
but got blessed +0 [DDSM. Later I asked for +2 fireproof [BoS, and
got +0 fireproof [BoS. After getting teleport and teleport control,
I rob Vaults and bring money to priest in Minetown. Robbed fort Luidois
and did the same with money. And so on. After it game became quite easy.
I found only one magic marker, used it up for enchanting armor.
Played with succubies, ate wraiths and so on. Two times felt in water
and lost few books, two times MF ate my brains. My spellbok of identify
was used up, so I went from mazes back to top and start polymorphing
everything to get magic marker. I got lot of gems by such way, but
never seen a marker. :( So I wished for it, and Heart of Ahriman, because
every monster seems to hear me. Everybody, who could shoot, did it with
amusing accuracy. But Heart didn't helped much, as =RoC did :).
Also I wished for rustproof [HoB. Found two extra BoH, but left them.
So, the second part of game was quite easy. I never lost more then
half of HP, and quaffed !PoH only for increase of max HP.
Going back with "AoY, I found djinn in bottle and he granted me wish.
I'm asked for Orb of Fate, but got nothing, what didn't upset me much.
I could get much more wishes from two wands. 
At stairs of 1 level I stopped and made post "Last steps to YAFAP", red
the answer (thank you, Wes Irby!), cleared inventory and calmly went up.
After half of an hour, I won the game. Death and Famine appeared to be
very weak, because of theirs low HP. On lava level I was very accurate.
It seems what difficulty of game somewhat uneven and it much harder at
